# SEO Optimization Guidelines

## Front Matter SEO Fields
Always include these SEO-related fields in your front matter:

```yaml
---
title: "Descriptive Title with Keywords"
description: "A compelling 150-160 character description of the content"
keywords: "keyword1, keyword2, keyword3"
author: "Nick Huang"
last_modified_at: YYYY-MM-DD
canonical_url: "https://nickhuangcyh.github.io/zh/blog/your-post/"
---
```

## Content Optimization
- **Titles**: Include primary keywords, keep under 60 characters
- **Headings**: Use H1 for main title, H2-H6 for structure
- **Meta descriptions**: Write compelling summaries (150-160 characters)
- **Keywords**: Focus on relevant technical terms and concepts

## URL Structure
- Use descriptive, keyword-rich URLs
- Follow the pattern: `/blog/category/post-name/`
- Avoid special characters and use hyphens for spaces

## Image Optimization
- Use descriptive alt text for all images
- Compress images for faster loading
- Use appropriate file formats (JPG for photos, PNG for graphics)
- Include image dimensions in HTML

## Internal Linking
- Link to related posts and pages
- Use descriptive anchor text
- Create topic clusters around main themes
- Include breadcrumb navigation

## Technical SEO
- Ensure mobile responsiveness
- Optimize page load speed
- Use proper heading hierarchy
- Include structured data where appropriate
- Set up Google Search Console and Analytics

## Content Categories
Focus on these main topic areas:
- **Design Patterns**: Software architecture and design principles
- **DevOps**: Jenkins, CI/CD, automation
- **Development Tools**: GitHub, development workflows
- **Tutorials**: Step-by-step technical guides
- **Academic**: Research and publications

## Tags and Categories Guidelines
**IMPORTANT**: Always use English for tags and categories to maintain consistent URLs across languages.

### Tag Guidelines
- Use English tags only: `tags: [Design Pattern, Software Engineering, Programming]`
- Avoid Chinese characters in tags: ❌ `tags: [設計模式, 軟體工程]`
- Use consistent terminology across all posts
- Keep tags specific and relevant to the content

### Category Guidelines
- Use English categories only: `categories: [Design Pattern, DevOps]`
- Avoid Chinese characters in categories: ❌ `categories: [設計模式, 開發工具]`
- Use broad, consistent category names
- Limit to 1-2 categories per post for better organization

### URL Consistency Benefits
- Maintains clean, SEO-friendly URLs
- Prevents URL encoding issues
- Ensures consistent navigation structure
- Improves search engine indexing

